  "lines": [
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L001",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F00",
      "panel_id": "p34_lotus_council",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "kind": "narration",
      "spoken_text": "Uno de los líderes de la estación «Archivo Viviente» invitó a Mika y a sus compañeros y comenzó su relato.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/es/CH03_P04_L001_es.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 6.766,
      "camera_target": [
        0.47,
        0.136,
        0.214
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "bd4ea3ff583afb0c84ce3ac5c6c54a461710903ebeb212ea1414c746307a5706"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L003",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F01",
      "panel_id": "p34_lotus_council",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "No nos llamamos Seres de Fase por casualidad. Nuestra vida pasa por tres estados.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/es/CH03_P04_L003_es.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 5.486,
      "camera_target": [
        0.76,
        0.135,
        0.158
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.25,
      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "fc0dd04a0f415f22d53c6cc25a9b4b4659cddda7fe257f92cc7a2a9e79ce8645"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L002",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F00",
      "panel_id": "p34_lotus_council",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "¿Como el agua?",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/es/CH03_P04_L002_es.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 1.306,
      "camera_target": [
        0.49,
        0.131,
        0.155
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.25,
      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "30218defa4a3f25cc6e955319d8995c8fb99bbd97e88010b0529c4b276153204"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L004",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F02",
      "panel_id": "p34_liquid_phase",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "No exactamente. Nacemos en un estado más gaseoso: nuestras moléculas están muy alejadas unas de otras.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/es/CH03_P04_L004_es.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 7.549,
      "camera_target": [
        0.255,
        0.347,
        0.165
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.4,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "908fb88cd6bf8b3a6058cdff9c4c65a19e4e4bf528cfa4944701b35e2d2a71ea"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L005",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F03",
      "panel_id": "p34_crystal_phase",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Con el tiempo nos volvemos más densos y adoptamos una forma líquida o gelatinosa. Y al final de la vida, nos cristalizamos.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/es/CH03_P04_L005_es.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 8.673,
      "camera_target": [
        0.735,
        0.348,
        0.165
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.4,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "88ec846661c2045aedfd54ea7392d32ac5f2f4c5afa415ef5f089b68bcc5761c"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L006",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F04",
      "panel_id": "p34_phase_cavern",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Según una de nuestras teorías, provenimos de antiguos cristales cósmicos que incluso se encuentran en asteroides.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/es/CH03_P04_L006_es.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 7.001,
      "camera_target": [
        0.49,
        0.545,
        0.18
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.4,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "805bea608c40454a42512f19d1d49fd26dd52093e9363a99c96e67179509fa1a"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L007",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F04",
      "panel_id": "p34_phase_cavern",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Quizá eso se convirtió en nuestra desgracia. Otras razas consideran que los cristales que quedan después de nosotros son tan valiosos como los que extraen del espacio.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/es/CH03_P04_L007_es.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 10.031,
      "camera_target": [
        0.5,
        0.545,
        0.18
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.25,
      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "1f4976483d165b4b4b8cb20401be7172a748fe35a0fbcb433145fd77bb9e3e98"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L008",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F04",
      "panel_id": "p34_phase_cavern",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Pero para nosotros, son la memoria de nuestros antepasados.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/es/CH03_P04_L008_es.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 4.284,
      "camera_target": [
        0.5,
        0.535,
        0.18
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.25,
      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "37811c7a41490a93ab24f43093d91dc87d8f2677aa28760a653d154136b64aad"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L009",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F05",
      "panel_id": "p34_new_hero",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Y quiero agradecerles que hayan ayudado a detener al lagarto.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/es/CH03_P04_L009_es.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 3.709,
      "camera_target": [
        0.22,
        0.752,
        0.141
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.4,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "ebc4b5e0bf8e90b953fa802210b72b8ed3c117cc1a428fb25f40a9f362b26540"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L010",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F06",
      "panel_id": "p34_new_hero",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Quiero presentarles a mi hijo, el príncipe de nuestro pueblo. Propongo que viaje con ustedes.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/es/CH03_P04_L010_es.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 6.113,
      "camera_target": [
        0.21,
        0.776,
        0.142
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.25,
      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "475f412c9e832043135150d63036729c25347c695aa3c4f04d4ada36861885fe"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L011",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F07",
      "panel_id": "p34_ship_departure",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "No puedo responder a tus preguntas sobre tu planeta natal, Mika. Pero los ayudaré a seguir adelante, hacia la galaxia de Barnard.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/es/CH03_P04_L011_es.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 7.811,
      "camera_target": [
        0.69,
        0.805,
        0.218
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.4,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "21a063d112ac305311d425154511d3f8dceea3d1a0b6d8d3a88a276885ea105f"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L012",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F07",
      "panel_id": "p34_ship_departure",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Pero ten cuidado: ¡hay muchos piratas allí!",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/es/CH03_P04_L012_es.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 3.396,
      "camera_target": [
